---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---
<BaseLayout title="方案與定價 — flowcook">
  <section class="bg-header py-16 text-white sm:py-24">
    <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Pricing</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">方案與定價</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85">
        導入費（一次性）+ 年費（含顧問點數與 AI 使用額度）— 依你公司的流程數量與導入範圍，聊完再給你完整報價。
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:wilson_you@tsuyoshitech.com" class="btn-primary mt-8">直接寫信報價</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
